---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact & Corrections" description="Contact information and correction guidance for the Teaching and Learning Mathematics Online companion site.">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact &amp; corrections</p>
      <h1>Found something wrong? Good.</h1>
      <p>Mathematics improves when somebody points at the mistake. So do websites.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Website corrections</h2>
        <p>For corrections to this companion site, bibliographic questions, broken links, or contributor information, contact <a href="mailto:jh@jameshoward.us?subject=TLMO%20website">James P. Howard, II</a>.</p>

        <h2>Book errata</h2>
        <p>If you are reporting a possible correction to one of the books, please include the edition, chapter number, page or section if known, and enough context to identify the issue. Confirmed corrections can be published on the <a href="/errata/">errata page</a>.</p>

        <h2>Publisher matters</h2>
        <p>Orders, permissions, accessibility requests for the published books, and publisher-controlled electronic editions should be directed to CRC Press / Routledge through the relevant edition's publisher page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
